  "description": "Western Brother is a bold vintage display font inspired by the authentic spirit of the American Wild West. Featuring strong slab serifs, distressed textures, and classic western letterforms, this typeface is perfect for creating eye-catching designs with a rustic, cowboy-inspired look.\nIdeal for logos, branding, posters, t-shirts, packaging, labels, signage, invitations, social media graphics, Cricut projects, laser cutting, and other DIY crafts. Whether you’re designing for country events, western festivals, rodeos, whiskey labels, or vintage branding, Western Brother delivers a timeless western aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western Brother is a bold vintage display font inspired by the authentic spirit of the American Wild West. Featuring strong slab serifs, distressed textures, and classic western letterforms, this typeface is perfect for creating eye-catching designs with a rustic, cowboy-inspired look.</p>\n<p>Ideal for logos, branding, posters, t-shirts, packaging, labels, signage, invitations, social media graphics, Cricut projects, laser cutting, and other DIY crafts. Whether you’re designing for country events, western festivals, rodeos, whiskey labels, or vintage branding, Western Brother delivers a timeless western aesthetic.</p>",
